{"id": "EUVD-2026-96896", "enisaUuid": "b62e0c5b-d98e-3f4c-a039-2edadf8bea83", "description": "Raven 2.0.0 through 3.0.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in legacy methods in raven/api/raven_message.py that skip the workspace membership check. Authenticated non-members can call get_messages_with_dates or get_all_files_shared_in_channel with predictable channel IDs to read Public channel history and Open/Public channel file metadata across workspaces.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T12:19:37", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:20:42", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind/frappe-raven-legacy-endpoints-workspace-isolation-bypass", "https://github.com/The-Commit-Company/raven/blob/a732e10f9c8b2ab3446038396e3eea763da617e7/raven/api/raven_message.py#L580-L595", "https://github.com/The-Commit-Company/raven/blob/a732e10f9c8b2ab3446038396e3eea763da617e7/raven/permissions.py#L165-L170", "https://github.com/The-Commit-Company/raven", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/raven-2.0.0-through-3.0.0-missing-authorization-via-legacy-message-and-file-apis"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108730", "GHSA-vq7v-p77q-r9cp"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6e3f59df-7958-3b4c-a441-b0177f6187a3", "product": {"name": "raven", "vendor": {"name": "The-Commit-Company"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 \u22643.0.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "6ed8e1a9-2233-3fe3-bcf0-2bc252947c17", "vendor": {"name": "The-Commit-Company"}}], "isExploited": false}